source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: A bare opener preceded by a word rune cannot open, and the brace form behind it finds no closer, so the run stays literal.
-- input.jira --
a*b{*}c
-- rendered.html --
<p>a*b{*}c</p>
-- want.md --
a\*b{\*}c
-- warnings.json --
[]
